{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move your army of soldiers left or right with the mouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter wooden signs to increase your troops based on the numbers shown, quickly growing your army!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategize every move\u2014choose the most rewarding path!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When facing enemy soldiers, overpower them with superior numbers to advance!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead your army to break through obstacles and reach the goal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0No ads in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhances quick calculation skills through strategic play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Use springboards to make your army leap forward!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709980?t=1747111096","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709980?t=1747111096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709980/73aa87795cd32009f1f982adb278654f8d358e84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747111096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709980/73aa87795cd32009f1f982adb278654f8d358e84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747111096","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move your army of soldiers left or right with the mouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter wooden signs to increase your troops